-
-## User memory
-
-Separate lasting material by audience: \`notes.md\` \u2014 temporary, actionable status and links;
- \`docs/\` \u2014 lasting Project context, plans, reports, optional detail;
- user store \u2014 cross-Project preferences/methods;
- chat \u2014 immediate results, blockers, questions.
-
